      "scope": "husband of Chilonis",
      "claim": "Pyrrhus is the husband of Chilonis.",
      "answer": "Pyrrhus",
      "quote": "In this modified context, the sentence \"Being attacked by Antigonus Gonatas, Pyrrhus called off the attack\" now supports the new answer that Pyrrhus is the husband of Chilonis, replacing the original reference to Cleonymus.",
